  "an8.66:0.3": "6. Vimokkhasuttaṃ ",
  "an8.66:1.1": "‘‘Aṭṭhime, bhikkhave, vimokkhā. ",
  "an8.66:1.2": "Katame aṭṭha? ",
  "an8.66:1.3": "Rūpī rūpāni passati. ",
  "an8.66:1.4": "Ayaṃ paṭhamo vimokkho. ",
  "an8.66:2.1": "‘‘Ajjhattaṃ arūpasaññī, bahiddhā rūpāni passati. ",
  "an8.66:2.2": "Ayaṃ dutiyo vimokkho. ",
  "an8.66:3.1": "‘‘Subhanteva adhimutto hoti. ",
  "an8.66:3.2": "Ayaṃ tatiyo vimokkho. ",
  "an8.66:4.1": "‘‘Sabbaso rūpasaññānaṃ samatikkamā paṭighasaññānaṃ atthaṅgamā nānattasaññānaṃ amanasikārā ‘ananto ākāso’ti ākāsānañcāyatanaṃ upasampajja viharati. ",
  "an8.66:4.2": "Ayaṃ catuttho vimokkho. ",
  "an8.66:5.1": "‘‘Sabbaso ākāsānañcāyatanaṃ samatikkamma ‘anantaṃ viññāṇa’nti viññāṇañcāyatanaṃ upasampajja viharati. ",
  "an8.66:5.2": "Ayaṃ pañcamo vimokkho. ",
  "an8.66:6.1": "‘‘Sabbaso viññāṇañcāyatanaṃ samatikkamma ‘natthi kiñcī’ti ākiñcaññāyatanaṃ upasampajja viharati. ",
  "an8.66:6.2": "Ayaṃ chaṭṭho vimokkho. ",
  "an8.66:7.1": "‘‘Sabbaso ākiñcaññāyatanaṃ samatikkamma nevasaññānāsaññāyatanaṃ upasampajja viharati. ",
  "an8.66:7.2": "Ayaṃ sattamo vimokkho. ",
  "an8.66:8.1": "‘‘Sabbaso nevasaññānāsaññāyatanaṃ samatikkamma saññāvedayitanirodhaṃ upasampajja viharati. ",
  "an8.66:8.2": "Ayaṃ aṭṭhamo vimokkho. ",
  "an8.66:8.3": "Ime kho, bhikkhave, aṭṭha vimokkhā’’ti. ",
  "an8.66:8.4": "Chaṭṭhaṃ. "
}
